# YogaSala Plus Mobile — Architecture

## Feature layout

```
lib/features/<feature>/
  data/api/          # *_endpoints.dart + *_api_client.dart
  data/datasources/  # abstract + *_impl
  data/models/       # @JsonSerializable DTOs → toEntity()
  data/repositories/ # XRepositoryImpl (@LazySingleton(as: XRepository))
  domain/entities|repositories|use_cases/
  presentation/bloc|pages|widgets/
```

Copy **teachers**, **activity**, or **live_sessions** when adding features.

## Naming: Repository vs Service

- Domain port: `XRepository` in `domain/repositories/`
- Data adapter: `XRepositoryImpl` in `data/repositories/` — even when it wraps a third-party SDK (e.g. RevenueCat → `PurchasesRepositoryImpl`)
- Do **not** name repository implementations `*Service`
- Reserve `*Service` for cross-cutting infra already in the app (e.g. `LoggerService`), not feature data adapters

## DI & domain

- `injectable` + `getIt`; run `build_runner` after new annotations
- `@injectable` use cases/blocs; `@lazySingleton` / `@LazySingleton(as:)` for API/repos/DS
- Use cases: `extends BaseUseCase<T, Params>`; Params `Equatable` or `NoParams`
- Repos: `Future<Either<Failure, T>>`; `try/on Object` → `_errorHandler.handleError`

## Shared locations

- Enums → `lib/core/enums/` only (never feature folders)
- Router → `lib/core/navigation/app_router.dart`
- Errors → `ErrorMapper` in `lib/errors/`
- i18n → `assets/lang/en.json` + `tr.json` (snake_case keys)

## Style

- Follow `very_good_analysis`; public APIs get `///` docs
- Imports: dart → packages → `core/` → `di`/`errors` → `features/`
- Do not invent endpoints/fields; do not call `/admin/...` from mobile
